%% render: auto
%% title: Master creative engineering architecture
%% desc: Layers activate only when the brief needs them. Cards name optional tools; kit/ has our own versions of most.
flowchart TD
    A["User intent and requirements • brief, audience, acceptance criteria"]
    B["Optional project intelligence • Graphify · Claude Mem · decision log"]
    C["Approved specification • Spec Kit or the project's own spec"]
    D["Creative direction and DESIGN.md • Taste · Frontend Design · Meng To"]
    E["Design and prototyping • Penpot · Stitch · Open Design · Figma"]
    G["AI-assisted 3D assets • SAM 3D · SF3D · TRELLIS.2 · UniRig · ComfyUI"]
    H["Spatial reconstruction • Gaussian Splatting"]
    F["Frontend and interactive UI • Magic UI · React Bits · Astryx · Three.js"]
    I["Animation and composition • HyperFrames · Remotion · GSAP · EffectCraft"]
    J["Post-production • Scarlet · Video Use · OpenScreen · FFmpeg"]
    K["Quality assurance and delivery • Impeccable · Hallmark · gates"]
    L["Reusable assets and decisions • manifest, DESIGN.md, decision log"]
    A --> B
    B -->|authorized context| C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    D -->|art direction| G
    D --> H
    E -->|tokens + prototype| F
    G -->|GLB| F
    G -->|renders| I
    H -->|splat renders| I
    F -->|build| K
    I -->|master| J
    J -->|encodes| K
    K -->|approved| L
    L -.->|next brief| B
    class A,C slate
    class B,D,L purple
    class E,F blue
    class G amber
    class H,I teal
    class J rose
    class K green
